{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521910001:1":{"text":"괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"你还好吗？<key:dialog53>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8EED9024064CA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521910002:0":{"text":"아니... 하나도 안 괜찮아...","source_cn":"不……一点都不好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F551DD6B24A9DBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521910003:1":{"text":"너희들... 너희들은 마법사지? 그렇지?\n전에 마법으로 날 구해줬다고 했잖아...","source_cn":"你们……你们是魔法师，对吗？\\n你之前说过，是用魔法救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBA2016F8E67DB41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521910004:1":{"text":"맞아요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 엄청 대단한 마법사예요.","source_cn":"是的，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7D18133BAF49E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 엄청 대단한 마법사예요.","female":"맞아요. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 엄청 대단한 마법사예요.","variant_male_record_index":"183791","variant_female_record_index":"183792","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521910005:1":{"text":"그러면 소원 하나만 들어줄 수 있어? 내가 죽기 전 마지막 소원이라고 생각하고...","source_cn":"你们可以满足我一个愿望吗？就当是……满足我死前最后一个愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3FEFF2835FE2A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1521910005":{"text":"그러면 소원 하나만 들어줄 수 있어? 내가 죽기 전 마지막 소원이라고 생각하고...","source_cn":"你们可以满足我一个愿望吗？就当是……满足我死前最后一个愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3FEFF2835FE2A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521910006:1":{"text":"난... 모르겠어...","source_cn":"我……我不知道……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7850EC3B4878CFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521910008:1":{"text":"나는 집으로 돌아가고 싶을 뿐이야... 내 고향으로 말이야...","source_cn":"我只是想回家……回我的故乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D295F9FB91AEF97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521910009:1":{"text":"재앙으로 인해 없어졌지만... 다시 돌아가고 싶어. 소중한 추억이 있는 곳으로...","source_cn":"虽然它也已经在灾难中毁灭……但我想再回去看看。那里有宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A81641B6964F287","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521910009":{"text":"재앙으로 인해 없어졌지만... 다시 돌아가고 싶어. 소중한 추억이 있는 곳으로...","source_cn":"虽然它也已经在灾难中毁灭……但我想再回去看看。那里有宝贵的回忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A